{"id":"c17b743e38f67165","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-cor-hausdorff-maximal.md","title":"Hausdorff Maximal Principle","display":"cor-hausdorff-maximal — Hausdorff Maximal Principle","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-hausdorff-maximal","aliases":["58-cor-hausdorff-maximal","Hausdorff Maximal Chain Corollary"],"display":"cor-hausdorff-maximal — Hausdorff Maximal Principle","depends_on":["[[58-thm-zorn]]","[[58-thm-hausdorff]]","[[58-df-chain]]","[[58-df-poset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-hausdorff-maximal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-hausdorff-maximal</span><span>Hausdorff Maximal Chain Corollary</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-hausdorff-maximal — Hausdorff Maximal Principle"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2830b5df14164544\" href=\"?note=2830b5df14164544\" title=\"58-thm-zorn\">58-thm-zorn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb3f769749168a6\" href=\"?note=5fb3f769749168a6\" title=\"58-thm-hausdorff\">58-thm-hausdorff</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a07664003abe8d32\" href=\"?note=a07664003abe8d32\" title=\"58-df-chain\">58-df-chain</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,R\\in V\">\\(P,R\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(R\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span> (set and binary relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\)</span> (partial-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,R)\\)</span> (chain predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a07664003abe8d32\" href=\"?note=a07664003abe8d32\" title=\"58-df-chain\">58-df-chain</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\\in\\mathsf{Theory}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\in\\mathsf{Theory}\\)</span> (ambient theory)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\\vdash \\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\to\\exists C\\subseteq P\\bigl(\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,R)\\land\\forall D\\subseteq P\\,((C\\subseteq D\\land\\mathrm{Chain}(D,P,R))\\to D=C)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ZFC}\\vdash \\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\to\\exists C\\subseteq P\\bigl(\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,R)\\land\\forall D\\subseteq P\\,((C\\subseteq D\\land\\mathrm{Chain}(D,P,R))\\to D=C)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every partial order contains a maximal chain.</li>\n<li>This is equivalent, over ZF, to the maximal-chain form of the axiom of choice.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-thm-zorn","status":"resolved","id":"2830b5df14164544","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-thm-zorn]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-thm-hausdorff","status":"resolved","id":"5fb3f769749168a6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-thm-hausdorff]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-chain","status":"resolved","id":"a07664003abe8d32","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-chain]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)$ (partial-order predicate, see [[58-df-poset]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-chain","status":"resolved","id":"a07664003abe8d32","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,R)$ (chain predicate, see [[58-df-chain]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}\\in\\mathsf{Theory}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}\\vdash \\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\to\\exists C\\subseteq P\\bigl(\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,R)\\land\\forall D\\subseteq P\\,((C\\subseteq D\\land\\mathrm{Chain}(D,P,R))\\to D=C)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1000,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-62","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-cor-hausdorff-maximal.md|58-cor-hausdorff-maximal]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["2830b5df14164544","5fb3f769749168a6","a07664003abe8d32","d3f859dbdd37f018"]}